    "highlights": "Links use a distinct underline offset (`0.2em`) and thickness (`0.06em`) for readability, while animated display typography reveals words sequentially using staggered transition-delays on inline spans. Tags and badges employ inverted or subtle backgrounds with tight line-heights to stand out cleanly.",
    "insights": [
      "The pairing of custom Anthropic Sans for headings and Anthropic Serif for body copy establishes a strong, editorial aesthetic, reinforcing a thoughtful, research-driven brand voice.",
      "A meticulously scaled fluid typography system using `clamp()` ensures consistent, proportionate hierarchy across varying viewport sizes, especially for large display text (e.g., Display XXL).",
      "Utility-first text classes (e.g., `u-display-*`, `u-paragraph-*`, `u-detail-*`) separate visual hierarchy from semantic HTML tags, offering maximum composability without relying on direct tag-based styling."
    ]
